---
import BookLayout from "../../layouts/BookLayout.astro";
import book from "../../data/book.json";
import study from "../../data/study.json";
const parts = [...new Set(book.chapters.map((chapter) => chapter.part))];
const lessons = study.lessons.filter((lesson) => lesson.linear);
const answers = study.lessons.filter((lesson) => !lesson.linear);
---

<BookLayout>
  <div class="book-introduction">
    <img src="/projects/orange/book-cover.svg" alt="The Orange Book cover: the Orange emblem in cream on an orange field." width="400" height="560" />
    <div>
      <p>The Orange Book explains why Orange exists, what it is intended to become, what has actually been built, and which questions remain open.</p>
      <p class="book-introduction-note">Part 1, The Novice, is the new way in: no programming or cryptography is assumed. The original manuscript is still here, in its own order. Two later novice lessons are not written yet.</p>
      <span class="book-edition">Novice draft {study.snapshot} · Manuscript {book.version}</span>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/book/before-we-begin/">Start with the novice <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/book/preface/">Original preface</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="study-path" aria-label="How the book is organized">
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">Part 1</p>
      <h2>The Novice</h2>
      <p>Draft lessons you can read now, from messages and binary through a first Orange program.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">Part 2</p>
      <h2>The Journeyman</h2>
      <p>Mapped to original chapters. The connecting lessons are not written yet.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">Part 3</p>
      <h2>The Master</h2>
      <p>The manuscript’s account of claims, proofs, and evidence. Integration is still a draft.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <section class="book-contents-list" aria-labelledby="novice-contents-title">
    <h2 id="novice-contents-title">Start here</h2>
    <div class="book-contents-group">
      <h3>Part 1, The Novice</h3>
      <ol>
        {lessons.map((lesson) => (
          <li><a href={`/book/${lesson.slug}/`}><span>{lesson.title}</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="book-contents-group">
      <h3>Worked answers</h3>
      <ol>
        {answers.map((lesson) => (
          <li><a href={`/book/${lesson.slug}/`}><span>{lesson.title}</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="book-contents-list" aria-labelledby="book-contents-title">
    <h2 id="book-contents-title">Original manuscript</h2>
    {parts.map((part) => (
      <div class="book-contents-group">
        <h3>{part}</h3>
        <ol>
          {book.chapters.filter((chapter) => chapter.part === part).map((chapter) => (
            <li><a href={`/book/${chapter.slug}/`}><span>{chapter.title}</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    ))}
  </section>
</BookLayout>
